        <mxCell id="f1_a" value="Clean instance&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Start with 8 points.&lt;br&gt;Lose 3, then gain 2.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Question: What is the final total?&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Solver: 8 - 3 + 2 = 7&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#263238;fontSize=18;spacing=14;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#EAF2F8;strokeColor=#377EB8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
